## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design precise resource accounting at OS level, handle races, and ensure fairness under contention.

## Key Concepts
- Per-core accounting, PMU counters, energy deltas
- Quanta windows and atomic updates
- Throttling policies and starvation avoidance
- I/O crediting and test methodologies

## Code Example
